\title{The Ethereum Setting}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-18}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    The constraints that come from the deployment target rather than the mathematics. [Ethereum](dhsorens-ethereum) wants blocks proved in seconds, on modest hardware, at a security level nobody is willing to negotiate — and increasingly with post-quantum assumptions. See [protocol snarkification](dhsorens-0020) for the broader effort, and [Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol](dhsorens-0022) for the talk.
}

